      "rationale": "Malphite is winning too much in solo queue (53.4% WR globally and in KR, 16-18% ban rate) but barely shows up in pro play (2% presence). Players mostly complain about his early lane damage. Seismic Shard is the poke he uses to win lane early, so we're lowering its damage at ranks 1-3 (70/120/170 -> 60/105/150). Ranks 4-5, the ratios and his ultimate engage stay the same, so his late-game teamfight job doesn't change. In the sim, solo queue power drops by about 1.8%, near the middle of the target band. Pro power stays the same or goes up slightly (+0.8%). Lane trades at level 6 go from 335 to 321."
     }
